  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5606.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5606.01 Purpose. This part sets forth the procedures for obtaining approval by the department for the scanning, recording, retaining or storing of personal information from a license, pursuant to RSA 263:12, X.",
